// Dialog :
"P244552427" "This is the body of a member of the Freakshow. He was badly injured, then killed execution-style."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3968461309" "You rescued the Chinese ambassador and the other captives from the Malta Group's agents."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2473086170" "I'm glad to see you were able to take care of this, {HeroName}. I'm sure that the Chinese embassy will send you some kind of certificate of thanks for your part in all of this. <br><br>Now, one of the hostages you rescued, Jack Firenze. I've heard of him; he's the head of the CIA's China Bureau. That makes him top brass, a real insider. Which makes me wonder why he would be here advising the U.S. ambassador in person for these talks. They're important, sure, but it's odd that they'd send a top man like him to do this in person when a subordinate would be fine. Maybe I'm just paranoid, but I got the feeling that there might be more going on here that we know. I'm going to keep looking into this. Check back with me later."
// RandomFameString :
"P2967077678" "I heard that you rescued the Chinese ambassador, {HeroName}, but the news didn't say who you rescued him from."

