"P3581117366" "You're dead!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P689620285" "Kingdom Red 2-0-2"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3995390764" "Moment shouldn't need the ambassador for much longer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3578524829" "You will not take out my facility, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2649892973" "Rescue the real ambassador"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2443962308" "I had thought I would die down here, {Rescuer}. Truly, I must thank you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4176169316" "You rescued Ambassador Zheng Xiaoxuan and defeated his captors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P568714038" "The real ambassador is a smart one. He put himself under protective custody with Freedom Corps until either he can prove his identity, or someone can catch the shapeshifter who's pretending to be him. He knows that if he just showed up without any support over at the embassy while Moment's still in control, he'd have no guarantee that it would go his way. He's planning something with Leung Linwei, but it might be wise if other forces handled this, and by 'other forces,' I do mean us. Indigo and I will try to find the perfect opportunity. <br><br>Meanwhile, I'll also check into that Dr. Lamarr that Ambassador Zheng mentioned seeing while he was a captive. I think we're starting to get close to the larger picture. Check back with me soon, there's gonna be a lot more before this is done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta1_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1370246152" "Thanks to you, Ambassador Zheng is safe and sound and under Freedom Corps protection. The problem is that the shape-shifter who was impersonating him is still in charge of the Chinese embassy, and still causing trouble. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>However, because you were thorough and made sure that none of the Malta agents holding the real ambassador were able to get word out that you freed him, this presents us with a window of opportunity to catch the shape-shifter 'Moment.'</A> <br><br>{HeroName}, It's time to put an end to this situation, but don't think that this one is going to be easy. I highly recommend you take some allies along with you on this."
// AcceptString :
"P2903684225" "Catch the shape-shifter 'Moment'"
// SendOffString :
"P2526516811" "Glad as always to see that you can follow through. Here's the situation: <br>Indigo has been monitoring signal traffic around the Chinese embassy, and it just paid off. Seems that Moment, disguised as the ambassador, is going to an Asia-Pacific business conference. From the looks of things, this could be the best chance to catch him off-guard. He'll no doubt be heavily guarded, but this could be our best shot. You'll need to defeat and capture Moment, and you'd better make sure to catch any men around him too. He is a shape-shifter, so you don't want to give him a chance to get away."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1636281537" "Defeat Moment & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4025510852" "You'll need to catch Moment himself to finish this. Make sure to catch any of the men around him, too. We don't want to find out he got away somehow by disguising himself as a subordinate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3446809321" "Everything explodes into chaos the moment you enter the building! Malta Group operatives remove disguises and ready themselves to attack!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3006250117" "Moment"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P927595082" "This operation is over. Time for a more combat-oriented form, I think."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2723088495" "So, {HeroName}, what do you think of this form?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1334112634" "Hostage"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P750026406" "Ambassador Zheng was saying the strangest things about the 'threat of America to his people!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P402405104" "Ambassador Zheng turned into a monster! I saw it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2718718395" "My friend just called and told me Ambassador Zheng is on TV, claiming the ambassador here is an imposter!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2619004135" "You have defeated the shape-shifter Moment and broken his grip on the Chinese embassy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2576123006" "You did a superb job on this one, {HeroName}. Ambassador Zheng Xiaoxuan and his assistant Leung Linwei are back in control at the Chinese embassy, and Moment is in custody. Thing is, that still leaves us with two loose ends: <br><br>First off, Moment seems to have been working for Malta, but why would the Malta Group want to try to destabilize relations between the US and China? <br><br>Secondly, Ambassador Zheng mentioned a Dr. Lamarr who was also in captivity. I did some checking, and there is a Dr. Hedia Lamarr who went missing from Lawrence Berkeley Labs over a year ago. That might be a match, but the missing Dr. Lamarr was working on some kind of environmental clean-up technology. That doesn't sound like something that would interest Malta, so if Ambassador Zheng did meet her, and she's being forced to work for Malta, then why? <br><br>I know I've had to leave you with some dangling questions in the past, and I will probably have to do so again in the future. This time, however, I think I'm gonna need your help on these loose threads. Indigo and I'll get to investigating, so check back real soon. It ain't over yet."
// RandomFameString :
"P110839201" "I saw that big fight at the conference! How did you know Ambassador Zheng was replaced by a shape-shifter, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta1_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P861595707" "While the situation at the Chinese embassy is back to normal, that doesn't mean that this is all over and wrapped up. Indigo is looking for more information on that Dr. Lamarr, and while she's doing that, I have some questions about Moment and the Malta Group's motives I would like to have answered. Now, I know a place that might have some of those answers, but I'm pretty sure that they won't want to share them no matter how nicely you ask. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go in there and look for information on Malta's objectives in the least nice manner as you can muster.</A> Are you in?"
// AcceptString :
"P1275174759" "Look for clues to Malta's motives at a Malta base"
// SendOffString :
"P1582049342" "The base I'm sending you to experienced a surge of activity just before they switched Moment and Ambassador Zheng. My guess is that they had Moment staying there up until that point. They'll probably start destroying information soon, so this could be our only chance to find out what's going on. Your objective is to search the place for any intel you can find about Malta's overall plan. Be thorough, but don't worry about taking out every last soldier."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P132826075" "Search Malta base for clues"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1299236441" "Your objective is to search that base for any intel you can find about Malta's overall plan. Be thorough, but don't worry about taking out every last soldier."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4175225476" "Hidden deep under the streets of the city, this hidden lab was all but undetectable."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P111762070" "O.R. Support unit 04"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
