// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1167494335" "You won't take my base from me, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2233407592" "Factory Computer"
// Description :
"P2551679982" "Search for useful intelligence"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2604914774" "You found a message on the Malta computer."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3197649783" "You defeated the leader of the Titan assembly base, and found some valuable information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1305097828" "They've built a second Titan. I was afraid of that, and all that you've found confirms it. They probably rushed it into production after they had to deploy that first one. That's some kind of bad news, but at least it's good to know about it. What's better, however, is the other piece of information you found. Director 17 is hidden within the CIA, and is still in town. I'm going to tap some CIA resources and see if I can narrow the list of possibilities, or even force Director 17 out into the open. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta1_Mission12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4162487102" "Now that we know that Director 17 is in the CIA, thanks to you, several encrypted messages Indigo had intercepted make more sense. I activated one of our resources, a former CIA agent, and sent him in to use his old contacts and try to connect who was sending those messages with who was receiving them. My plan succeeded better than I anticipated, and Malta Group agents jumped our man, taking him prisoner. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to liberate our ex-CIA informant from the Malta Group and find out what he learned.</A> <br><br>He's going to be under heavy guard, but I don't think it's anything you can't handle. Well, maybe you and some friends."
// AcceptString :
"P3235546410" "Liberate the ex-CIA informant from the Malta Group and find out what he learned"
// SendOffString :
"P1979128634" "As I said, our plan worked better than I had planned. When those Malta operatives grabbed our man, they tipped their hand that he found out something important. What Malta didn't know is that Indigo monitored their whole operation remotely, thanks to their compromised network, we know exactly where they took him, and we know that they plan to interrogate him before they kill him. Our operative is a tough one to crack, so we should have some time. But don't dawdle. All you need to do is go in and retrieve our man and learn what he knows."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3099161736" "Find abducted agent"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2262801828" "Our operative is a tough one, so we should have some time. But don't dawdle. All you need to do is go in and retrieve our man and learn what he knows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3129750502" "Indigo's information has led you to this old warehouse. The black vans outside show that this is the right spot."

