// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3943875572" "That second Kronos Titan could smash down the War Wall and level part of the city! You've got to stop it! Destroy the Titan and defeat all of the support personnel so they can't get it up and running again!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P4067516548" "Coastal Preserve"
// EntryString :
